# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep ONLY what the game needs to build and run: source (scripts/, scenes/),
# content (data/, assets/), project config (project.godot, export_presets.cfg,
# .gitattributes), the icon, the CI workflow (.github/) and BUILD.md.
# Everything else — our design decisions, logs, reviews, evidence, build output,
# engine caches — is ignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Our working material: design decisions, reviews, logs, evidence, galleries
design/
review/
docs/
notes/
logs/
*.log
*.jsonl

# Godot engine cache & imports
.godot/
.import/
export.cfg
export_credentials.cfg
*.translation

# Mono / C#
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json

# Exported / packaged game builds
build/
*.pck
*.zip
*.exe
*.wasm

# Session scratchpad (headless Godot, downloads)
scratchpad/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
